    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this lovely own door, ground floor two-bedroom apartment ideally located in the ever popular Newlands development. The development is gated, fully secure and perfectly located with all necessary amenities close by including shops, bars, cafes and restaurants with Corkagh park just a stone's throw away and accessible from within the development. Conveniently located close to Dublin bus stops and the red line LUAS. The M50 and N7 motorways are also close by making commuting easy. Clondalkin village is easily accessible by foot..\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 65 sqm comprises of entrance hallway, large living room with dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms (one master with ensuite) and main family bathroom. The property is not overlooked and located in a quiet part of the development with minimal passing traffic and ample parking is available.\n\nNo. 25 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners perfect for any first-time buyer looking to get on the property ladder, downsizers or investors. It boasts a long list of additional features such as brand new blinds, built in wardrobes & top-quality fixtures & fittings to name but a few. Early viewing is highly advised, call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nFeatures;\n- c. 65 sqm\n- BER C\n- 2 BED / 2 BATH\n- MGMT fee c. 1,300 per annum\n- Ground floor apartment\n- Great condition throughout\n- Communal garden\n- Peaceful gated development\n- Gas central heating\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom\n- Within minutes of Clondalkin Village\n- Easy access to the N7 and M50 Motorways\n- Ideal for first time buyers and investors alike\n- Access to Corkagh Park within the development\n\nBER details\nBER: C1\n\nDirections\nEircode: D22 C8H0"
      },
      {
